### List every locale/namespace under .migration/locales
GET http://localhost:4000/content-load?query=locales

### Every namespace for a single locale
GET http://localhost:4000/content-load?query=locales.en-US

### A single namespace file for a locale
GET http://localhost:4000/content-load?query=locales.en-US.app

### Drill into a key inside that namespace
GET http://localhost:4000/content-load?query=locales.en-US.app.name

### Non-English locale
GET http://localhost:4000/content-load?query=locales.fr-FR.nav

### Missing query param -> error response
GET http://localhost:4000/content-load

### Unknown path -> error response
GET http://localhost:4000/content-load?query=locales.xx-XX
